name: Workspace preparation refusal is visible, idle and explicitly recoverable
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_feedback.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
keys: C-g
require-live-snap: 20 COMMAND PALETTE | palette
type: scopes
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 scope.toml | workspace-refused
expect: preserved.
expect: Enter / c build inventory
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_feedback.py refused @TMP_TARGET @ART
resize: 160x48
live-snap: refusal-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: refusal-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: refusal-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: refusal-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: refusal-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: refusal-read-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: refusal-last-40x12
ask: Can the operator read the actual workspace refusal, see that no work is running, and find retry or Back across all six sizes and the narrow reader?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI | back-after-refusal
keys: C-g
require-live-snap: 20 COMMAND PALETTE | reopen-palette
type: scopes
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 ┌ SCAN SCOPES | refusal-kept-on-return
expect: scope.toml
expect-not: COMMAND PALETTE
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_feedback.py fix @TMP_TARGET @ART
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 No saved scope inventory | explicit-read-retry
expect-not: Action stopped
expect-not: Working · Ctrl+C cancel
keys: c
require-live-snap: 30 DRAFT SCOPES | inventory-recovered
expect: Inventory limited: true
expect: Boundary: .
expect: Scan context:
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_feedback.py recovered @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does an explicit retry after correcting the owned fixture's ignore policy recover inventory without approving a scan, changing source or making a model request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
keys: C-g
require-live-snap: 20 COMMAND PALETTE | restart-palette
type: scopes
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES | recovered-draft-after-restart
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/preparation_feedback.py restarted @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does no-color restart read the recovered unaccepted draft while retaining zero discovery work and zero provider usage?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
